OL,3,GNEWSAStudents worried about university
OL,4,Astaffing cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents have reacted to plans to
OL,7,Freduce staffing costs at their
OL,8,Funiversity.
OL,10,FAnglia Ruskin University, which has
OL,11,Fcampuses in Chelmsford, Cambridge, and
OL,12,FPeterborough, said it would be aiming
OL,13,Fto reduce its staffing bill of about
OL,14,F#150m by 10%, the BBC understands.
OL,16,FThe university said it was "facing a
OL,17,Fnumber of significant financial
OL,18,Fchallenges" and must manage its
OL,19,Fexpenditure carefully to protect its
OL,20,Flong-term future.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
