OL,3,GNEWSAStudents worried about university
OL,4,Astaffing cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than half of the undergraduate
OL,7,Fstudents based at the university's
OL,8,Fcampus in Peterborough, which opened in
OL,9,F2022, are from the local area, and many
OL,10,Fsay they would not have gone to
OL,11,Funiversity if the campus did not exist.
